WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.608 --> 00:00:02.932
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>They’re having</b> a party next door.

2
00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:07.732
Oh no! <b>The baby’s crying</b>.

3
00:00:09.035 --> 00:00:10.533
<b>It’s raining</b>.

4
00:00:12.032 --> 00:00:13.422
<v><b>A:</b></v> What <b>are you doing</b>?

5
00:00:13.726 --> 00:00:16.028
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>I’m waiting</b> for my brother.